  "about": [
    "Goals and decisions (envisioning/starlings#261, #262), stored in Core. A goal",
    "sits on one project; a decision belongs to one subject of any kind and",
    "may cite a goal. The rules every surface shares — which goals are live,",
    "which are late, and the Overview order — are pinned here.",
    "TypeScript: packages/contracts/src/goals-decisions.ts. Swift:",
    "Sources/GoalsDecisions.swift, reading this same file."
  ],
  "rules": [
    "STATUSES: open | met | dropped. SOURCES: message | meeting | manual | agent.",
    "LIVE: a goal is live while open. The task picker offers live goals only.",
    "LATE: a live goal whose target_date (a civil YYYY-MM-DD) is before today,",
    "civil days in the caller's zone. Met and dropped goals are never late.",
    "ORDER: open first, late before on-time, soonest target first, undated",
    "last, ties by title; then met, then dropped, newest updated_at first."
  ],
